    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="68.1b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 68.1b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þi we sculon medemian ⁊ gescadelice todælan ylde ⁊ geogoðe, [welige ⁊ wædle, frige ⁊ þeowe], hale ⁊ unhale.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And therefore we must make due allowance and carefully distinguish between age and youth, wealth and poverty, freemen and slaves, the sound and the sick.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þy we sceolon medmian ⁊ gesceadlice todælan ylde ⁊ geogoþe, welan ⁊ wædle, freot ⁊ þeowet, hæle ⁊ unhæle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
